<Base title="Page Fault" description="404 — this page is not mapped in this process's address space.">
  <h1>Page Fault</h1>
  <p class="meta">SIGSEGV — the address you requested was never mapped.</p>
  <p>
    Whatever used to live here has been moved, renamed, or never existed in
    this address space to begin with. Unlike a real page fault, there's no
    handler that's going to page this back in for you.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/">Return to a valid address →</a></p>
</Base>
